:"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_dynamic_checkout":false,"skip_cart":false,"uppercase_text":true,"icon_scale":120,"icon_spacing":10,"atc_custom_label":"","display_price":false,"enable_custom_color":false,"custom_color":"#53af01","enable_secondary_btn":false,"secondary_btn_label":"Buy It Now","secondary_btn_enable_custom_color":false,"secondary_btn_custom_color":"#dd1d1d","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":24}},"collapsible_tab_fC3Agw":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Payment & Delivery","heading_size":"medium","icon":"","filled_icon":false,"collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":true,"open":false,"content":"<h4><strong>Payment<\/strong><\/h4><p>You can safely pay with Klarna, credit card, or bank transfer – choose what works best for you.<br\/><\/p><h4><strong>Shipping<\/strong><\/h4><p><br\/>We offer different rates for the UK and the Rest of the World:<\/p><ul><li><strong>United Kingdom (UK): <\/strong>Standard Shipping: <strong>£2.00<\/strong> (Free on orders £37 and over)Priority Shipping: <strong>£4.50<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Rest of the World:<\/strong>Standard Shipping: <strong>$2.95<\/strong> (Free on orders $49 and over)Priority Shipping: <strong>$6.00<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Delivery Time<\/strong><br\/><br\/>As our UK warehouse is temporarily out of stock, your order will be shipped from our international warehouse.<br\/>We offer two shipping options at checkout:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Standard Shipping:<\/strong> 1–2 days handling + 5–10 days shipping time<\/li><li><strong>Priority Shipping:<\/strong> 1–2 days handling + 4–7 days shipping time<\/li><\/ul><p>A tracking number will be sent by email as soon as your order leaves the warehouse.<\/p><p><strong>Questions?<\/strong><br\/>Email us at <strong>info@shopvetpets.com<\/strong> – we always reply within 24 hours on weekdays.<\/p>","page":"","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":0}},"collapsible_tab_iQb3wA":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"100-Day Money-Back Guarantee","heading_size":"medium","icon":"","filled_icon":false,"collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":true,"open":false,"content":"<p>We truly believe your product from us will make a difference – for both you and your dog.<br\/><br\/>That’s why we offer a <strong>100-day money-back guarantee<\/strong>.<\/p><p>You can try the product at home, in your own time.<br\/><br\/>Not completely satisfied? Then you’ll get your money back – no stress, no hassle.<\/p><p>For us, it’s more important that your dog gets the care they deserve than that you keep something you don’t love.<\/p><p><strong>You can read more about our satisfaction guarantee here.<br\/><\/strong><a href=\"\/pages\/100-dagers-fornoydgaranti\" title=\"100-Day Money-Back Guarantee\">100-Day Money-Back Guarantee<\/a><\/p>","page":"","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":0}},"custom_liquid_bgawBg":{"type":"custom_liquid","settings":{"custom_liquid":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <style>\n    .custom-shipping-container {\n      display: flex;\n      padding: 6px 16px;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      background-color: #f6f6f6;\n      border-radius: 20px;\n      margin-top: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .custom-shipping-item {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n\n    .text-block-shipping {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: #000;\n    }\n\n    .shipping-date {\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n\n    .shipping-worldwide {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: #000;\n    }\n\n    .shipping-worldwide .bold {\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n\n    .green-circle {\n      animation: fade 1s ease-in-out infinite;\n    }\n\n    @keyframes fade {\n      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n      50% { opacity: 0.5; }\n    }\n\n    .flags-container {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 6px;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n    \n    .custom-icon {\n      width: 16px;\n      height: 12px;\n    }\n  <\/style>\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function() {\n      function getNextWeekday(date) {\n        var day = date.getDay();\n        var daysToAdd = (day === 5) ? 3 : (day === 6) ? 2 : 1;\n        return new Date(date.setDate(date.getDate() + daysToAdd));\n      }\n\n      var today = new Date();\n      var shipDate = getNextWeekday(today);\n      \n      \/\/ Format date to have short month (e.g., \"Thu, Feb 22\")\n      var options = { weekday: 'short', month: 'short', day: 'numeric' };\n      var formattedDate = shipDate.toLocaleDateString('en-US', options);\n      document.getElementById('shipping-date').textContent = formattedDate;\n\n      \/\/ Fetch country data using GeoJS API\n      fetch('https:\/\/get.geojs.io\/v1\/ip\/geo.json')\n        .then(response => response.json())\n        .then(data => {\n          console.log(\"Geolocation API Response:\", data); \/\/ Debugging log\n\n          if (!data || !data.country_code) {\n            throw new Error(\"Invalid data from API\");\n          }\n          \n          var countryCode = data.country_code.toUpperCase(); \/\/ Get country code (e.g., \"GB\", \"US\")\n          var flagUrl = `https:\/\/flagcdn.com\/w40\/${countryCode.toLowerCase()}.png`;\n\n          \/\/ Set flag and country code\n          document.getElementById('country-flag').src = flagUrl;\n          document.getElementById('country-flag').alt = countryCode + \" Flag\";\n          document.getElementById('country-flag').style.display = \"inline\";\n          document.getElementById('country-text').innerHTML = `Free <span class=\"bold\">${countryCode}<\/span> Shipping`;\n        })\n        .catch(error => {\n          console.error('Error fetching the IP information:', error);\n          document.getElementById('country-flag').style.display = \"none\"; \n          document.getElementById('country-text').innerHTML = \"Fast Worldwide Shipping\";\n        });\n    });\n  <\/script>\n<\/head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"custom-shipping-container\">\n    <div class=\"custom-shipping-item\">\n      <svg class=\"green-circle\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 13\" fill=\"none\">\n        <circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#137333\"\/>\n      <\/svg>\n      <div class=\"text-block-shipping\">Ships by <span id=\"shipping-date\" class=\"shipping-date\"><\/span><\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"custom-shipping-item flags-container\">\n      <img id=\"country-flag\" class=\"custom-icon\" src=\"\" alt=\"Country Flag\" style=\"display: none;\">\n      <div id=\"country-text\" class=\"shipping-worldwide\">Loading...<\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/body>\n<\/html>"}},"custom_liquid_tdTfb6":{"type":"custom_liquid","settings":{"custom_liquid":"<!-- Snippet: stock-status.liquid -->\n<div class=\"stock-status-wrapper\">\n  <span class=\"stock-status-dot\"><\/span>\n  <span class=\"stock-status-text\">Low stock due to Black Month Sale<\/span>\n<\/div>\n\n<style>\n  .stock-status-wrapper {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n\n  .stock-status-dot {\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 14px;\n    background-color: #ff9900;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    animation: stockPulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n\n  .stock-status-text {\n    color: #ff9900;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n\n  @keyframes stockPulse {\n    0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n    50% { transform: scale(1.3); opacity: 0.7; }\n    100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n  }\n<\/style>"}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{"margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":24}},"e7a28cbe-03cb-4c9d-a2c4-0e3e76ffb3e5":{"type":"sticky_atc","settings":{"function":"add_to_cart","display_when":"after_scroll","button_label":"Add to cart","enable_custom_btn_color":false,"custom_btn_color":"#dd1d1d","color_scheme":"background-1",